  // Alexandria only: whether this website's daily refund cap is reached; feedback about other websites can still refund.
  websiteCapReached?: boolean | null;
}>>; };
```"},{"name":"mcp__codex_apps__search_service_web_run","description":"Tool for accessing the internet.


